                "description": "Deltana CHBT Ball Cabinet Finial - An easy screw-on installation makes this cabinet hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishing details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Ball cabinet finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use. Available in 8 finishes.",
